---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { CANON_PATHS } from "../lib/site";
import { LINKS, linkClass, btnPlan } from "../lib/links";
import { withBase } from "../lib/base";

const ext = { target: "_blank", rel: "noopener noreferrer" };
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Grok Bot setup | Coriolis, LLC"
  description="One session. Your Cursor seat. One Grok Bot, configured and trained. $995. We never rent you ours."
  path="/grok-bot-setup"
  ogImagePath={CANON_PATHS.grokBot}
>
  <section class="border-b border-zinc-800/80 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <p
        class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold"
      >
        AI Studio
      </p>
      <h1
        class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl"
      >
        Grok Bot setup
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        The industry is buying chat. The operators who will still be standing
        are buying a teammate with a computer.
      </p>
      <img
        src={withBase(CANON_PATHS.grokBot)}
        alt="Grok Bot"
        width="1920"
        height="1080"
        class="mt-8 w-full min-w-0"
      />
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        Coriolis already runs this way. Grok Bot is SpaceXAI’s agent: it has
        its own computer, it signs into the tools you already use, and it keeps
        working when you close the laptop. We will not rent you our seat. We
        will sit with you for three hours, configure one Grok Bot on the Cursor
        account you buy, write the rules, connect the MCP you already own, and
        train the owner or manager who will live with it.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href={withBase("contact")} class={btnPlan}>Talk to Coriolis</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-zinc-800/80 py-12">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">
        You buy the seat. We configure it.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        Grok Bot is included on these plans, billed by Cursor / SpaceXAI, not
        by us:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 max-w-3xl list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-zinc-300">
        <li>Cursor Teams Premium — $120 per seat per month</li>
        <li>Cursor Ultra — $200 per month</li>
        <li>SuperGrok Heavy — $300 per month</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        Those prices are theirs (<a href={LINKS.xaiBot} class={linkClass} {...ext}
          >https://x.ai/bot</a
        >). Buy one before the session. Sign in with that account. We configure
        on your seat.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
        Cursor’s Terms of Service, section 1.5(iii), bar anyone from renting,
        leasing, lending, or selling the service. We will not put you on a
        Coriolis Ultra box and call it a product. If someone offers you “our
        Grok Bot” as a subscription, they are selling you a seat they do not
        own.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-zinc-800/80 py-12">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">What $995 is</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        One time. Not a monthly SKU.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        Three hours, one Grok Bot, on your seat:
      </p>
      <ol class="mt-4 max-w-3xl list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm text-zinc-300">
        <li>
          Consult. What the bot is for, what it must never do, who owns it.
        </li>
        <li>
          Configure. Name, rules, the MCP connectors you already have. We do
          not sell you connectors.
        </li>
        <li>
          Train. The owner or manager sits in the session and leaves able to
          run it.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        Then 30 days of async support on that bot only. Email and tickets. Not
        24/7. Not a second bot. Not a helpdesk for the rest of the company.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
        After 30 days, anything else is a ticket. Joel gates it. It is billed.
        There is no retainer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-zinc-800/80 py-12">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">What it is not</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        <p>
          It is not a Coriolis product. It is a setup session for a product you
          buy from Cursor and SpaceXAI.
        </p>
        <p>
          It is not Grok Bot 24/7 support from us. The bot can work around the
          clock. We do not.
        </p>
        <p>
          It is not a way around a seat. No shared login. No “we host it for
          you.”
        </p>
        <p>
          It is not on the homepage. Ecommerce stays the front door.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">After the session</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        You have one named Grok Bot, on your account, with rules you approved,
        and a person in the building who can steer it. You can add more bots
        later. That is more tickets, not a package we invented.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href={withBase("contact")} class={btnPlan}>Talk to Coriolis</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-10 max-w-3xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">
        Disclaimer: Grok Bot is a product of SpaceXAI, available through
        Cursor. Marks of their owners. Coriolis, LLC configures on the
        client’s seat. We are not affiliated with SpaceXAI or Anysphere beyond
        that work. Prices for Cursor Teams Premium, Cursor Ultra, and SuperGrok
        Heavy are set by them and can change.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
